1
00:00:00,254 --> 00:00:02,634
(Leonard(pulling out a toy lightsabre):)You call that a glow stick?

2
00:00:07,595 --> 00:00:09,595
(Leonard(pulling out a toy lightsabre):)That is a glow stick.

3
00:00:10,515 --> 00:00:11,595
Come on, Iet's go.

4
00:00:11,766 --> 00:00:13,436
Before you go, consider this:

5
00:00:13,601 --> 00:00:17,141
(Sheldon:)Not only do I have a deep-cycle
marine battery power source...

6
00:00:17,313 --> 00:00:19,903
(Sheldon:)...more than capable of running
our entertainment system...

7
00:00:20,066 --> 00:00:24,736
(Sheldon:)...I also have all 61 episodes
of the BBC series Red Dwarf.

8
00:00:24,904 --> 00:00:27,864
And Fiddle Faddle.

9
00:00:28,032 --> 00:00:32,282
(Sheldon:)All yours if you're willing to reinstate
the Roommate Agreement.

10
00:00:32,453 --> 00:00:36,123
(Penny:)I've got wine at my place
and some bubble wrap we could pop.

11
00:00:40,962 --> 00:00:46,012
(Sheldon:)He'll be back. Wine and a girl in the dark,
he's gonna be bored out of his mind.

12
00:00:48,052 --> 00:00:49,592
(Leonard:)To wine and bubble wrap.

13
00:00:51,973 --> 00:00:55,683
(Leonard:)And to not having to watch Sheldon
demonstrate his reverse-osmosis machine...

14
00:00:55,852 --> 00:01:00,022
(Leonard:)...that converts urine into drinking water.

